Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 19:23:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] dev-nle: compiled scaled-DDM (DDMnle) path, from the NLE
 repository's patch

src/model_NN.h: a `scaled` flag on the flow_joint native spec with the
eight DDM columns; nn_trial_ll_scaled() forms kappa, eta, Z, SZ and
c = (s/a)^2, one density call at st0 = 0, a CDF pair otherwise.
src/flow_ddm.cpp, src/nle_native.h: nle_ddm_native_full() returns the
log pdf and the defective CDF together. R-side wiring follows.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XqrarSBWux5YK24WSya9Bm
